@table
UP literacy (2011) | Figure
State | **67.7%** (31st of 35 states and UTs in 2001)
Highest district | **Gautam Buddha Nagar (80.1%)**, Kanpur Nagar, Auraiya, Etawah
Lowest district | **Shravasti (46.7%)**
